*Infinite [[Wall Doge]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 8.33~33.33 seconds<sup>250f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Two Can]]s spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>.
