==Trivia==
*Slave to Energy's Japanese name, Enajī Dorei (エナジー奴隷, "Energy Slave") is a pun on the term ''enajī dorein'' (エナジードレイン, "energy drain"), which refers to when a spiritual being drains the lifeforce of a human.
*Prior to [[Version 11.2 Update|version 11.2]]:
**[[Wall Doge]] spawned every 3.33~13.33 seconds throughout the entire battle, rather than slowing down to every 8.33~33.33 seconds after some time.
**The [[Two Can]]s came in trios rather than pairs.
**[[Gory Dark]] and [[Dark Otter]] spawned infinitely.

